  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">L5-96 BanaPads Limited entreprenurial support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L5-96 BanaPads Limited entrepren&#xf6;rsst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BanaPads m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttning &#xe4;r att knyta an forskning f&#xf6;r kvinnilg hygien till samh&#xe4;llet och industrins behov. BanaPads har utvecklat enkostnadseffektiv dambinda som en del av forskningsagendan,produkten har testas under 2012 med i ett begr&#xe4;nsat marknadssegment (skol&#xe5;ldern female, 10-19) med hj&#xe4;lp av ett Avon-f&#xf6;rdelningsprogram och funnit det vara l&#xf6;nsamt. Avtalspart &#xe4;r BanaPads Limited, org.nr 156995 Uganda och 96347 Tanzania.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BanaPads principle objective is to link female menstrual hygiene research to community and industry needs. BanaPads has developed a    cost effective sanitary napkin as part of its research agenda, tested the product in 2012 with in a restricted market segment menstruating  school age females (10-19) using an Avon-style distribution program   and found it to be viable. Agreement partner is BanaPads Limited, org reg no 156995 Uganda and 96347 Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
